# The public search wrapper: one block name in, the body walks until that block
# is within mining reach. A goal may name a place ("go to a block", decision
# 2026-11-12 "Wider tasks"), and a goal is verified by the skill's own `done`,
# so the search needs a done check of its own on top: `search_surface` is the
# helper that decides how to look, but its contract is the surface walk, while
# this skill is done the moment the block is near, whatever put it there (a
# block the body placed itself counts, and so does one a caller's goal already
# reached).
#
# Depth 2: find_block -> search_surface (a leaf). Ordered: the done check first,
# then exactly one action. `search_surface` explores until the block is in
# reach and fails `not_found` after its own three explores; that kind is this
# skill's failure after the usual three tries, and the caller decides whether to
# search again from somewhere else.
skill find_block(block: block)
  doc "Walk until the given block is within mining reach (5 blocks); fails not_found when the surface search runs out."
  rules:
    near($block, 5) -> done
    true -> do search_surface($block)
